00:07:55.057 --> 00:07:57.935
However, the main problem
with traveling backwards in time,

00:07:57.935 --> 00:08:00.188
which at this point is
thought to be impossible due

00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:02.398
to something
known as the grandfather paradox,

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:04.984
And comes from the idea
that if a person travels

00:08:04.984 --> 00:08:09.197
to a time before their grandfather
or had children and killed that same person,

00:08:09.197 --> 00:08:12.825
that act would make their very own birth
impossible to begin with.

00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:14.452
But according to some physicists,

00:08:14.452 --> 00:08:17.413
this problem can be avoided
by something called the

00:08:17.413 --> 00:08:21.459
Novikov's self consistency principle,
which is a theory on paper at least,

00:08:21.459 --> 00:08:23.836
that would allow for such a paradox
to happen,

00:08:23.836 --> 00:08:28.007
meaning you could in fact go back in time
and be able to change the course of history.

00:08:28.007 --> 00:08:30.760
But rather than alter
the present, you could simply create

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:35.348
another timeline that would never interfere
with the current timeline you just came from.

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:37.934
This is called
the many worlds interpretation,

00:08:37.934 --> 00:08:40.811
meaning that there is a possibility
that the Time Traveler kid

00:08:40.811 --> 00:08:43.523
in fact may never have been able
to alter the present

