00:12:39.467 --> 00:12:43.637
And I mean knowing your enemy is
the first step towards defeating your enemy.

00:12:43.637 --> 00:12:44.472
Which is why

00:12:44.472 --> 00:12:49.059
I would not only spend the day with Nana,
I would pester her every single day

00:12:49.059 --> 00:12:54.064
to figure out just what exactly is her powers
what her limits are and her weaknesses.

00:12:54.064 --> 00:12:57.610
Does it tire her out to read minds?

00:12:57.610 --> 00:12:58.569
Once we figure out

00:12:58.569 --> 00:13:00.237
her limitations will be better able

00:13:00.237 --> 00:13:03.073
to piece together
if and what she could be able to do,

00:13:03.073 --> 00:13:05.326
and which will give us a better chance
to figure out

00:13:05.326 --> 00:13:08.287
and prove
that she is lying to us and everyone here.

00:13:08.329 --> 00:13:12.082
Because the problem with Nana's powers,
unlike the fire guy's powers, for example,

00:13:12.082 --> 00:13:15.085
is that her power doesn't involve
any perceivable change

00:13:15.085 --> 00:13:17.421
within her surrounding environment,
which means that

00:13:17.421 --> 00:13:20.633
for all we know,
she could simply be lying about her mind.

00:13:20.633 --> 00:13:22.718
Powers, whom I mean, it could be real

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:26.555
because we can actually see if she's doing
what she's been saying she's been doing.

00:13:26.555 --> 00:13:28.307
And that is a problem.

00:13:28.307 --> 00:13:33.103
The entire classroom then agrees to let Nana
be the new leader of the group, but Kyouya

00:13:33.103 --> 00:13:34.480
notices something is off.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:38.025
Regarding the stab wound at home,
Kyouya begins to theorize

00:13:38.025 --> 00:13:42.279
that the girl intentionally hurt herself,
knowing that Michiru would heal her wounds.

00:13:42.279 --> 00:13:44.448
However, he can't seem to find a reason why

00:13:44.448 --> 00:13:47.618
the girl would be trying
to kill his entire classroom.

00:13:47.618 --> 00:13:48.577
Outside of the dorms.

00:13:48.577 --> 00:13:51.705
This student approaches
Nana and tells her that he's discovered

00:13:51.705 --> 00:13:53.332
something strange about the girl.

00:13:53.332 --> 00:13:54.250
The student reveals

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:58.546
that he can see into the future and whips out
a photograph showing Nana killing him.

00:13:58.546 --> 00:14:02.466
They sit down at the cafeteria
to sort out their problems and the future.

00:14:02.466 --> 00:14:03.717
Seeing Kid explains that

00:14:03.717 --> 00:14:08.722
whatever he sees in his future
photographs will happen with 100% accuracy.

00:14:08.722 --> 00:14:12.059
Suddenly he brings out a photo of her
killing the now that night,

00:14:12.101 --> 00:14:15.312
a future seeing kid blackmails her
into giving him a back massage

00:14:15.312 --> 00:14:16.564
like a dirty bastard.

00:14:16.564 --> 00:14:20.109
They sleep in the same room overnight
and he wakes up to another surprise.

00:14:20.109 --> 00:14:20.734
From Nana.

00:14:20.734 --> 00:14:24.280
He explains that during his sleep,
five photos will come from this camera

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:28.158
that will predict the future. However,
he's only got four in his possession.

00:14:28.158 --> 00:14:31.996
He checks Nana's clothes to find a photo
showing Nana dead on the ground.

00:14:31.996 --> 00:14:34.373
She freaks out
and the man makes a deal with her.

00:14:34.415 --> 00:14:39.003
He's going to hide in the shed overnight
and see if the photo will come true.

00:14:39.044 --> 00:14:40.379
OK, this is insane.

00:14:40.379 --> 00:14:41.922
And what just happened proved that

00:14:41.922 --> 00:14:45.092
Nana is more of a devious
little turd blossom than we thought.

00:14:45.134 --> 00:14:46.844
However, this future seeing

00:14:46.844 --> 00:14:50.931
kid should have known that someone
who had the guts to come to a superhero field

00:14:50.931 --> 00:14:53.058
island and begin
killing people would have been

00:14:53.058 --> 00:14:55.686
a little more cunning
than your average little bird.

00:14:55.728 --> 00:14:59.690
The fact of that the matter is, is that this kid
knew who Nana really was when she first

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:04.278
came to the island and blackmailing her
into becoming his girlfriend was a bad move.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:08.115
However, this kid's power is very passive
and limited in scope.

00:15:08.115 --> 00:15:09.283
Therefore, he should have realized

00:15:09.283 --> 00:15:12.077
that Nana would have used his camera
to play a trick on him.

00:15:12.077 --> 00:15:14.538
I mean, it's
not that hard to put two and two together.

00:15:14.538 --> 00:15:18.208
In fact, I'm more surprised that no one
has tried to pull that trick on him before.

00:15:18.208 --> 00:15:20.753
Also,
already knowing the limitations of his powers

00:15:20.753 --> 00:15:23.297
means that he should have thought
that someone could have potentially

00:15:23.297 --> 00:15:27.927
shown him a fake picture of the future,
since clearly the photos that show the future

00:15:27.927 --> 00:15:32.681
looks identical to any Polaroid photo shot,
which means that this was his weakness

00:15:32.681 --> 00:15:35.517
and one he should have known to look out
for beforehand.

00:15:35.559 --> 00:15:40.439
Also, Nana in the picture is shown to die
by ligature strangled which in reality

00:15:40.439 --> 00:15:44.526
would have been a lot more difficult to do
and would have taken a lot longer to die,

00:15:44.568 --> 00:15:47.237
which can take anywhere
from one to 15 minutes.

00:15:47.279 --> 00:15:50.783
They should have, at the very least,
arised some suspicions within him,

00:15:50.783 --> 00:15:53.953
because if someone was choosing
to kill someone by choking them,

00:15:53.953 --> 00:15:56.205
they would have likely opted
to use their hands

00:15:56.205 --> 00:15:58.415
or something more sturdy than a jumping rope.

00:15:58.415 --> 00:16:01.335
Also, the one thing he had going for him
is that this picture

00:16:01.335 --> 00:16:05.839
showed the exact location of where
the future incident was going to take place.

00:16:05.839 --> 00:16:10.177
This meant he shouldn't have been so
willingly gone to the location to tempt fate.

00:16:10.177 --> 00:16:15.474
As Albert Einstein once said, our distinction
between past, present and future is only

00:16:15.474 --> 00:16:19.561
a stubbornly persistent illusion
because even if the future in theory

00:16:19.561 --> 00:16:23.357
was already written
just like the grandfather paradox, the future

00:16:23.357 --> 00:16:27.277
just like trying to change the past
would result in countless possible outcomes

00:16:27.277 --> 00:16:31.448
as to how the future would unfold,
since the future hasn't happened yet,

00:16:31.448 --> 00:16:35.744
meaning it can happen in one of many ways,
and this kid should have at least suspected

00:16:35.744 --> 00:16:41.000
that his premonitions were possible
outcomes not absolute truths, as he claims.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.460
In knowing this possibility,
this could have allowed the kid

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:46.630
to realize that he actually had
all of the time in the world

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:49.216
and should not have rushed to the shed
to begin with.

00:16:49.216 --> 00:16:51.010
Rather, he should have opted to hide

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:54.304
in an entirely different spot,
like in a friend's room, in a place

00:16:54.304 --> 00:16:57.725
that was closer to the main school
and its students that night.

00:16:57.725 --> 00:16:58.475
The future scene

00:16:58.475 --> 00:17:03.772
kid walks in and carelessly sits down,
not realizing that Nana is about to strike.

00:17:03.772 --> 00:17:05.899
Suddenly she attacks him with the same weapon

00:17:05.899 --> 00:17:08.694
from the photograph,
but the boy manages to fight her off.

00:17:08.736 --> 00:17:11.947
He pushes her to the ground
and is ready to enjoy his victory.

00:17:11.947 --> 00:17:14.992
But that's when Nana reveals
that she's pregnant with a poison needle.

00:17:14.992 --> 00:17:17.161
When he grabbed her,
the boy falls to the ground

00:17:17.161 --> 00:17:19.705
and she explains that the photo of her
dying was fate.

00:17:19.747 --> 00:17:23.083
However, she still took one
of his five photos from the night before.

00:17:23.125 --> 00:17:24.835
That's when the lights turn on to reveal

00:17:24.835 --> 00:17:28.172
what the stolen photo really was
and then Michiru and Kyouya,

00:17:28.213 --> 00:17:32.551
Walk in to find Nana caught red handed,
realizing that she's going to be found out.

00:17:32.551 --> 00:17:35.095
She begs Michiru to fix the boy up ASAP.

00:17:35.095 --> 00:17:38.140
She admits that the future seeing kid
was blackmailing her,

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:42.102
showing her embarrassing photos from the
future to pretend that they were going out.

00:17:42.102 --> 00:17:43.020
She blames the boy's

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:47.232
current state on a medical condition
or from the invisible enemies of humanity.

00:17:47.232 --> 00:17:51.528
A few hours later, Meet You two realizes that
her talent is beginning to make her tired.

00:17:51.528 --> 00:17:54.281
She rubs his back
and finds a photo inside his shirt.

00:17:54.281 --> 00:17:57.701
Suddenly Nana appears and questions
what she's looking at.

00:17:57.701 --> 00:18:01.163
Michiru hands over the photo, wondering
what the hell she just saw.

00:18:01.163 --> 00:18:01.872
Nana lies

00:18:01.872 --> 00:18:06.502
and says that the boy's future predictions
only show what he's seeing in his dreams.

00:18:06.502 --> 00:18:08.879
The next day
the class attends the boy's funeral.

00:18:08.879 --> 00:18:09.963
The principal complains

00:18:09.963 --> 00:18:14.593
about there being no police on the island,
and Kyouya interrupts to voice his suspicions.

00:18:14.593 --> 00:18:17.763
He demands an autopsy
when suddenly the coffin begins shaking

00:18:17.763 --> 00:18:19.389
and the boy comes back to life.

00:18:19.389 --> 00:18:21.141
This short kid walks in and reveals

00:18:21.141 --> 00:18:24.019
his talent is to be able to reanimate
two dead bodies.

00:18:24.019 --> 00:18:24.645
He tells them

00:18:24.645 --> 00:18:29.191
that the corpse will tell everyone
his cause of death if the body remembers OK.

00:18:29.191 --> 00:18:34.279
Kyouya now has one of the most important
assets on this island, and that is this kid.

00:18:34.321 --> 00:18:38.408
Because up until now, his gut has told him
who the real killer on this island is.

00:18:38.408 --> 00:18:43.080
And despite conveniently looking innocent
and kind of dumb, Julia knows that Nana's

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.375
whereabouts during all the murders
are too much of a coincidence.

00:18:46.416 --> 00:18:49.044
But what this guy needs,
just like in real life

00:18:49.086 --> 00:18:53.048
court cases, is the evidence
that directly connects Nana's dirty hands.

00:18:53.048 --> 00:18:54.925
With all the murders that have taken place

00:18:54.925 --> 00:18:59.138
so far, however, it's odd that despite
the piles of bodies growing over the last

00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:03.642
few days, that Kyouya hasn't already started
using the school's children to his advantage.

00:19:03.642 --> 00:19:06.520
Because, remember,
we're at a super powered school,

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.897
which means that it's not out of this world
to assume

00:19:08.897 --> 00:19:10.899
that the school is full of superpowered kids

00:19:10.899 --> 00:19:15.487
and would likely have class records detailing
just exactly what their powers all are.

00:19:15.487 --> 00:19:19.158
And Kyouya, clearly being all pally
with the teacher earlier,

00:19:19.158 --> 00:19:22.119
means that he could have easily snuck in
and got some access

00:19:22.119 --> 00:19:24.663
to get his hands
on those very important records.

00:19:24.705 --> 00:19:26.832
This means that all this time,
instead of whining

00:19:26.832 --> 00:19:29.751
and pouting about Nana being the killer,
he should have just started

00:19:29.751 --> 00:19:31.461
looking into all the kids powers

00:19:31.461 --> 00:19:35.048
that he could have better use to help him
find out the killer's identity.

00:19:35.048 --> 00:19:38.468
If he did this from the start
and go in all lone wolf detective,

00:19:38.468 --> 00:19:39.970
then he could have found out about this

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:42.848
necromancer kids abilities
from the very beginning.

00:19:42.931 --> 00:19:47.019
Kyouya wants to get to the bottom of this,
but everyone here says that reviving

00:19:47.019 --> 00:19:47.603
this corpse

00:19:47.603 --> 00:19:52.482
is too disrespectful, and no one here
is about to let him shit on this corpse.

00:19:52.482 --> 00:19:54.109
Kyouya then has no choice,

00:19:54.109 --> 00:19:58.322
and his investigation into who killed
this kid ends right here that night.

00:19:58.322 --> 00:20:00.115
Nana is in the short kid's room

00:20:00.115 --> 00:20:03.410
while he sleeps,
and she sticks a needle into the boy's neck.

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.245
Injecting poison into his body.

00:20:05.245 --> 00:20:08.957
She moves to his girlfriend's room
and gets ready to inject another needle

00:20:08.957 --> 00:20:11.668
when suddenly the short kid attacks
and holds her down.

00:20:11.668 --> 00:20:14.796
The girlfriend reveals
that she is the true necromancer

00:20:14.796 --> 00:20:17.382
and that her boyfriend is actually already
dead.

00:20:17.424 --> 00:20:20.510
Knowing that the girlfriend
is having relationship troubles,

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:23.680
she promises to tell what a short kid is
thinking if they let her up.

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:25.807
The girl obliges and Nana runs away.

00:20:25.807 --> 00:20:28.310
She escapes the dorm
and rushes into the forest.

00:20:28.352 --> 00:20:30.270
Necromancy Chick and her boyfriend

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:33.440
chase her down, looking around
and in the bushes for any sign of her.

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:34.942
Suddenly she pops out trying

00:20:34.942 --> 00:20:38.070
to grab the girl's necklace,
but her boyfriend is about to attack her.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:39.821
So she pushes the girlfriend over.

00:20:39.821 --> 00:20:44.826
They chase her deeper into the forest and
Nana is suddenly ambushed by more corpses.

00:20:44.826 --> 00:20:47.621
She runs into a broken shelter
and begins fixing it up.

00:20:47.621 --> 00:20:50.499
But they find her
and she runs inside to block the door,

00:20:50.499 --> 00:20:53.001
thinking she's safe and begins to set a trap.

00:20:53.001 --> 00:20:54.127
But Necromancy Chick

00:20:54.127 --> 00:20:58.340
already has a trap of her own asking,
Nana, didn't you check under the bed?

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:01.885
Suddenly three corpses jump out and attack
her, pinning her to the ground.

00:21:01.885 --> 00:21:06.348
But fortunately, for her, the sun has risen,
freezing the corpses in their tracks.

00:21:06.348 --> 00:21:08.350
Necromancy girlfriend here tells it

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:12.854
that the reanimated corpses can still move
as long as the light doesn't reach them.

00:21:12.854 --> 00:21:14.147
Oh kay.

00:21:14.147 --> 00:21:18.568
This twist is shockingly delicious,
but this chick could have been more careful

00:21:18.568 --> 00:21:20.487
and methodical from the jump.

00:21:20.487 --> 00:21:22.990
So far,
from what we've seen of this necromancer.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:27.327
Unlike Nana, this chick lacks
a killing spirit, and this battle was uneven

00:21:27.327 --> 00:21:31.999
from the start because despite her powers
and Nana seemingly lack of any powers

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:37.087
Nana seems to be the only one on this island
that truly possesses a murderer's mentality.

00:21:37.087 --> 00:21:40.674
The necromancer take from the get go should
have, at the very least, been more guarded.

00:21:40.674 --> 00:21:41.300
And if she couldn't

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:44.177
bring herself to kill Nana,
she should have incapacitated her

00:21:44.177 --> 00:21:47.264
by breaking her legs or something,
because this lack of foresight

00:21:47.264 --> 00:21:48.640
will come back to bite her.

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:53.645
Now, like most people, this necromancer chick
probably had some concept of time passing

00:21:53.645 --> 00:21:55.897
and therefore should have used this
to her advantage.

00:21:55.897 --> 00:21:59.651
Chasing Nana right before sunrise,
knowing that her powers stopped working

00:21:59.651 --> 00:22:01.445
technically during the day meant

00:22:01.445 --> 00:22:06.158
that she should have verbally stated to Nana
that she would give her a 12 hour head start

00:22:06.158 --> 00:22:10.746
to leave the island before evacuating
the premises with all of her corpse friends.

00:22:10.787 --> 00:22:13.665
All of this should have been done
before the sun rose.

00:22:13.665 --> 00:22:15.917
This could have kept up the illusion
that her powers

00:22:15.917 --> 00:22:19.129
had no limits in theory
and did not expire at sunrise.

00:22:19.129 --> 00:22:23.759
The fact that this necromancy check willingly
admitted her weakness too was beyond doubt.

00:22:23.759 --> 00:22:25.844
And the same thing with the future
singing kid.

00:22:25.844 --> 00:22:29.389
These kids have been way too willing
to reveal the limitations of their powers.

00:22:29.389 --> 00:22:31.058
Like Dang, what are you doing?

00:22:31.058 --> 00:22:32.100
Stop doing that.

00:22:32.100 --> 00:22:35.645
And did necromancy check locks a wounded
nana inside?

00:22:35.687 --> 00:22:39.941
24 hours later, she comes back to the shelter
where Nana staying, finding

00:22:39.941 --> 00:22:41.234
it completely empty.

00:22:41.234 --> 00:22:44.988
She sends her corpses out to search for her
and heads back to the dorms.

00:22:44.988 --> 00:22:48.241
But that's when Nana surprises them
and pushes them both over

00:22:48.241 --> 00:22:50.911
and takes a slip of paper
from her back pocket.

00:22:50.952 --> 00:22:52.871
She brings them to the cliffside
and threatens

00:22:52.871 --> 00:22:54.956
to drop the piece of paper into the ocean.

00:22:54.956 --> 00:22:59.086
If the item disappears, then the girlfriend
can no longer touch it to reanimate her.

00:22:59.086 --> 00:23:00.629
Short's dead boyfriend.

00:23:00.629 --> 00:23:04.508
Suddenly she poisoned the girl and drops
the piece of paper into the ocean.

00:23:04.508 --> 00:23:08.929
Nana disposes of the bodies and then finds
mysterious bully in the forest.

00:23:08.970 --> 00:23:12.766
She distracts the girl and poisons her
while she's not looking, telling her

00:23:12.766 --> 00:23:15.852
that she'll provide the antidote
in exchange for the girl's phone.

00:23:15.894 --> 00:23:19.147
She agrees and hands it over,
but Nana opens up her other hand,

00:23:19.147 --> 00:23:23.735
revealing that there was never any medicine
allowing the girl to die on the ground.

00:23:23.735 --> 00:23:26.780
The next day, Kyouya
questions her about the missing students.

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:31.118
She admits that they're all dead and brings
the class with her to see their corpses.

00:23:31.118 --> 00:23:33.620
She blames the short kids
death on his girlfriend,

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:36.248
claiming
that she tripped off the cliff to her death.

00:23:36.248 --> 00:23:40.794
She politely asks the skinheads
to burn the corpses along with the others

00:23:40.794 --> 00:23:45.424
in the forest in order to give the dead
a sense of dignity and closure.

00:23:45.424 --> 00:23:46.466
Yeah, right.

00:23:46.466 --> 00:23:49.719
OK, I got a call bullcrap
on what Nana is saying.

00:23:49.719 --> 00:23:51.763
Right now because this is so suspicious.

00:23:51.763 --> 00:23:54.766
Up until now,
she has literally been coincidentally

00:23:54.766 --> 00:23:58.395
unaccounted for during all of the murders
that have happened so far.

00:23:58.395 --> 00:24:01.398
But the problem is, even
with all of the coincidences in the world,

00:24:01.398 --> 00:24:04.901
unless we can directly link
Nana to all of this, we have nothing.

00:24:04.901 --> 00:24:09.030
Because in a court of law, the presumption
of innocence is a legal principle.

00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:11.950
That states
everyone is innocent until proven guilty.

00:24:11.950 --> 00:24:16.163
And to top it off, Nana comes off
as so freaking cute and adorable to the point

00:24:16.163 --> 00:24:17.497
that she is still our leader.

00:24:17.497 --> 00:24:20.292
And this means that just like trying
to make someone look guilty

00:24:20.292 --> 00:24:23.378
in front of a sympathetic jury,
this is going to be an uphill battle

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:25.464
because no one here is on our side to begin
with.

00:24:25.464 --> 00:24:28.508
And the perception of Nana's character
means that everyone will find

00:24:28.508 --> 00:24:31.720
any compelling coincidences or evidence
that we find against

00:24:31.720 --> 00:24:35.724
Nana to be just hearsay at best,
unless we catch her directly in the act.

00:24:35.724 --> 00:24:37.726
This means that we have two options. Really?

00:24:37.726 --> 00:24:39.644
Well, either need to catch a Nana or whoever.

00:24:39.644 --> 00:24:42.647
The real killer is dead
to rights in the middle of the next murder,

00:24:42.647 --> 00:24:45.108
or we need to make it
so increasingly difficult

00:24:45.108 --> 00:24:47.777
to the point to kill
were the effort to go through with any more

00:24:47.777 --> 00:24:50.405
murders won't be worth
the amount of pressure we're putting on.

00:24:50.405 --> 00:24:53.533
For the last part, I would say
now that even if we have no outside help

00:24:53.575 --> 00:24:56.578
coming to the island,
we need to start taking proactive measures,

00:24:56.578 --> 00:24:58.872
starting
with changing how this school operates.

00:24:58.872 --> 00:25:02.959
